// vStatus, and what only it reaches
//
// The simplest layout of protoStatusTemplate's status slips: a line of
// status text and the default (Stop/Cancel) button. A transport's
// SetStatusDialog names it ('vStatus); height is the slip's in pixels.

vStatus := {height: 56, name: 'vStatus, kids: [|Array|: @protoStatusText, @protoDefaultStatusButton]};
